M10 NE gate briefing: register the M10CON018 monitor before Start.

Primary objective 1006 (lower the Northeastern base gate) is added only from
M10_Conversation_Zone::Action_Complete(100018), when the zone-18 briefing
M10CON018 ends. M10CON018 is not a key conversation, so
ActiveConversationClass::Start_Conversation stops it with INTERRUPTED at once
when any key conversation is playing (the intro M10CON064, a zone briefing
such as M10CON007, or M10CON019). Retail registered the monitor after Start,
so that stop had no observer and 1006 was never added: no objective entry,
radar blip or HUD pog for the NE gate, while the gate poke still counted the
primary. Same pattern as scripts-a38-m10-objective-conversation-resend:
Monitor_Conversation now precedes Start_Conversation, so the preemption calls
Action_Complete synchronously inside Entered and the objective is added. The
normal path (no key conversation) is unchanged. already_entered is set before
the conversation, so the zone briefs once; a missing conversation (id < 0,
not reachable with retail m10.ldd) adds the objective directly.

--- a/Mission10.cpp
+++ b/Mission10.cpp
@@ -3775,8 +3775,14 @@
 					int id = Commands->Create_Conversation("M10CON018", 99, 2000, false);
 					Commands->Join_Conversation(NULL, id);
 					Commands->Join_Conversation(STAR, id);					
-					Commands->Start_Conversation(id, 100018);
+					// Vita: monitor before Start so a key-conversation preemption inside Start
+					// still reaches Action_Complete (and adds primary objective 1006).
 					Commands->Monitor_Conversation(obj, id);
+					Commands->Start_Conversation(id, 100018);
+					if (id < 0)
+					{
+						Action_Complete(obj, 100018, ACTION_COMPLETE_CONVERSATION_UNABLE_TO_INIT);
+					}
 				}
 				break;
 			case 20: 
